          "he": "לא מיגניא באפיה - בתמיה. אם אתה מצריכה בדיקה והלא תמאס ותתגנה בפניו:",
          "en": "“Does she not become repugnant in his eyes?”—this is a rhetorical question: If you require her to undergo an examination, will she not become distasteful and repugnant to him?",
          "explanation": {
            "title": {
              "he": "הסבר",
