                "en": "Rashi explicitly marks a rhetorical question. He is not describing the wife as already repugnant; he asks whether requiring her to examine would make her distasteful and repugnant to her husband. Distinguishing this question from a simple negative statement is essential to the alternative interpretation in the preceding counterpart."
              }
